// expect: a Cubemap has 'faces', its six sides as targets to draw into, not 'color'
// expect: the cube itself is what a frag reads: 'cube.Sample(direction)', where it's a field of a component or a singleton the frag takes
// It has no color of its own
scene Main { }
local singleton Room { Cubemap reflection; RenderTarget side; List<Vertex3> ball; }
view Show(Room room) { var image = room.reflection.color; }
